{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three ways to describe Unsound Love:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non-linear, open-world escape room experience where nothing is explained \u2014 and everything must be discovered.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Soulslike without combat.\u00a0(More about this below.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting blend of Outer Wilds and Little Nightmares \u2014 trapped in a time loop you must explore, unravel, and survive through horror-driven action-puzzle sequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All sounds</strong>, from the wind in the trees to the monsters' roars, are made with <strong>musical instruments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsound Love originally began as a fairly classic soulslike, featuring dodge rolls, combat systems, traps, and boss battles. However, after creating our first demo, we decided to remove many of these elements in order to explore other aspects of the soulslike genre that we personally love. As a result, the game may feel like a soulslike without a combat system, with a greater focus on exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not allowed to say anything else.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3315700?t=1773060704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3315700?t=1773060704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/9f2c4c3f33c80d05f92817d4590ffc27bd1e6928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773060704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/9f2c4c3f33c80d05f92817d4590ffc27bd1e6928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773060704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4435020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three ways to describe Unsound Love:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non-linear, open-world escape room experience where nothing is explained \u2014 and everything must be discovered.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Soulslike without combat.\u00a0(More about this below.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting blend of Outer Wilds and Little Nightmares \u2014 trapped in a time loop you must explore, unravel, and survive through horror-driven action-puzzle sequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/87b1a292388b66af2e582b581358fbb6.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All sounds</strong>, from the wind in the trees to the monsters' roars, are made with <strong>musical instruments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/a2743e7d4a0780139c514d7d2110835d.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsound Love originally began as a fairly classic soulslike, featuring dodge rolls, combat systems, traps, and boss battles. However, after creating our first demo, we decided to remove many of these elements in order to explore other aspects of the soulslike genre that we personally love. As a result, the game may feel like a soulslike without a combat system, with a greater focus on exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.poster.avif?t=1773060704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.webm?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/extras/010d93d5aa529dffbd50c761d76fffea.mp4?t=1773060704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not allowed to say anything else.</p>","developers":["Professional Villains"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315700/header.jpg?t=1773060704","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 professional villains 2024","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/331